---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import PostList from "../components/PostList.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const allPosts = await getCollection("blogs");
const recentPosts = allPosts
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.date.getTime() - a.data.date.getTime())
  .slice(0, 5);
---

<BaseLayout title="Dibin Jose">
  <section class="section">
    <p>
      I work as a software engineer, but I consider myself a student of computer
      science above all else. My true curiosity didn't wake up until after I
      finished my degree. Once it did, there was no going back. I’ve spent every
      year since continuously studying, diving deep into low-level mechanics,
      and building a ground-up understanding of software systems.
    </p>
    <p>
      Outside of software, I prefer to keep life simple and moving. You’ll
      usually find me on a bike, playing football or badminton, or traveling
      when I get the chance. Downtime is usually reserved for good books and
      cinema.
    </p>
    <p>
      You’ll find writing here on life beyond the terminal. It’s an unfiltered
      testing ground for thoughts, stories, and whatever I’m currently curious
      about.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2 class="section-title">Recent Writing</h2>
    <PostList posts={recentPosts} />
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
